message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "NPSS-Image: Block-DCT Shrinkage with Cross-Phase Structure Confidence"
abstract: "A training-free single-file image denoiser: 8x8 block DCT with 3-sigma hard thresholding, DC protection and multi-phase cycle spinning, plus a structure-confidence map built from per-phase keep/kill agreement that relaxes the threshold where structure is consistently recognised. numpy + Pillow only, CPU, no model weights."
